OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for SEND school building
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school for pupils with special
OL,7,Feducational needs in North East
OL,8,FLincolnshire has been granted
OL,9,Fpermission to build a new two-storey
OL,10,Fbuilding.
OL,12,FHumberston Park School, in Humberston,
OL,13,FGrimsby, caters for young people aged
OL,14,Fthree to 19 years who have complex,
OL,15,Fsevere, and profound learning
OL,16,Fdifficulties.
OL,18,FThe new development was needed as the
OL,19,Fcurrent learning environment was not
OL,20,Ffit for purpose, headteacher Richard
OL,21,FGargon said.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
